 691  0455              ; Layer 2 = the map at HL (G_MAP for a new screen, ZMAP to clear). (1) every cell in the old or the
 692  0455              ; new map becomes transparent; (2a) every foreground cell that is not a bush is drawn whole, as the
 693  0455              ; original hides figures (pillars, masonry, grass); (2b) bushes (bright green ink, attribute & 0x47 =
 694  0455              ; 0x44): per pixel line, every run of bush cells is drawn from its leftmost to its rightmost ink pixel,
 695  0455              ; the rest stays transparent: solid silhouettes whose edges follow the leaves, not the cells. Ink in
 696  0455              ; the cell's ink colour, paper in its paper colour, all with the priority bit (host's rules,
 697  0455              ; 2026-10-13); (3) the window's top frame line (y 14, x 6-249) is drawn whole in bright blue except
 698  0455              ; where a panel icon has a pixel (ZMAP: cleared). Then OLDMAP = the map.
